  </item>
  <item>
    <title>《婚姻与爱情》老编辑：有男朋友就不能单独见异性朋友吗？如何找到门当户对的爱情？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64591e2d587765c4234a427f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64591e2d587765c4234a427f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 May 2023 15:32:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期请回了“中国奇谭”的嘉宾无肉不欢，畅谈当代青年的爱情世界。</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">7:20</a>想有桃花运，为啥还不愿意跟异性玩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a>有男朋友了就不能单独跟异性朋友见面了吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a>包办婚姻的人生，丧失的不仅是爱情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a>“势均力敌、旗鼓相当”的爱情模式越来越多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>生活小窍门：跨越阶层的妙招</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a>犬儒主义者幸福法则：与其提高自己，不如贬低别人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a>伴侣出轨该不该原谅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3980">1:06:20</a>有些话只敢给兄弟/闺蜜说、不敢对伴侣讲，这会毁掉你的人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4490">1:14:50</a>推荐作品《初恋50次》、《白日梦想家》</span></p><br>]]></description>
