  <item>
    <title>我给井上改剧本，灌篮高手这样拍：良田绝杀第一扣，外传输给宇智波！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644168151a9456785db7edec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644168151a9456785db7edec</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Apr 2023 16:06:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>运动题材的精髓是不断犯错不断改，这部电影缺乏新一代篮球知识，控球后卫没有成长线索。</span></p><br><p><span>时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">0:55</a>主观打分，平均7分，音乐扣分太多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">4:45</a>从良田讲起，为何选他做主角？家庭线跟运动体育线完全不搭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a>防剧透绝招，大脑封闭术</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a>不在意结尾不等于不在意竞技过程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a>槽点：我能运球过半场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>槽点：良田没资格去美国，就是硬捧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>槽点：海难太容易猜，哥哥的护腕不如体操王子</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a>槽点：缺乏新一代篮球知识，控球后卫没有成长线索</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a>槽点：本体是耳钉的良田性格大反转</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a>槽点：井上厌女吗，刻板印象太多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a>槽点：井上二十年磨一剑打造出家庭伦理剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a>亮点：3D渲染2D</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a>槽点：山王的强势没有表现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a>亮点：关键球瞬间无声</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>槽点：进球之后缺乏爆发性的胜利庆祝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a>亮点：樱木救球归来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>槽点：赤木的转变太生硬，战术太少</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a>建议：从三井或木暮出发</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a>槽点：山王只会一波流吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a>槽点：泽北求神暗示宿命论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a>主角不是拯救世界的人，怎么拍更好看</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a>建议：我帮井上改剧本：让良田扣篮绝杀</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a>《卡卡西外传》完胜《宫城良田传》</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a>运动题材的精髓是不断犯错不断改</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a>幽默感和糗事太珍贵了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a>做任务和喜剧完美结合的作品《西游降魔》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3565">59:25</a>爱情线应该有吗</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3795">1:03:15</a>槽点：解说员的缺失不能忍！良田是罪犯！</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3970">1:06:10</a>建议：新干线列车上的故事，暴风雨前的宁静</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4060">1:07:40</a>期待《自来也外传》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4190">1:09:50</a>还期待看到灌篮高手哪些故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">1:12:30</a>推荐作品：《超级马力欧》、《平家物语：犬王》、《空中杀手》</span></p><br><br><br>]]></description>
