  <item>
    <title>实现女性主义要用什么办法？用说教反说教、用道德绑架捡软柿子捏？怎么看“服美役”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642aedb47fca62c9bf698283</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642aedb47fca62c9bf698283</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Apr 2023 14:22:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一位又老又新的嘉宾，赛布琳娜，怀念我们线上圆桌派的日子。</span></p><br><p><span>时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">0:35</a>几年前开始的私人圆桌派</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">3:35</a>美国的三八奖颁给了一个变性人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a>詹姆斯曾闹过的大笑话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a>重要的是办法，不是目的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a>女性主义的本质是女性尽可能地获得自由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a>厌女这个概念是一种语言的工具</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a>先锋前辈做的是重新解释女性从何而来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>被塑造的感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a>如何扭转无力感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a>处于同温层很幸福</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a>学习女性主义之前需要什么准备</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a>有影响力的人有义务发声吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a>用说教的方式反对说教，为什么有人会变得不择手段</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3455">57:35</a>一部分人更容易被欺负、被道德绑架，所以激进分子要捡软柿子捏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3625">1:00:25</a>所有的领导都是傻逼，没有例外</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3890">1:04:50</a>怎么看“服美役”这个词</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4090">1:08:10</a>不要讨论空泛概念，要把词语放在日常场景里去看</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4430">1:13:50</a>假如男人就是无法理解女人，又怎么样呢，女人也无法理解女人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4660">1:17:40</a>不要着急，不要着急，不要着急</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
