  <item>
    <title>新海诚铃芽之旅：不要做日本人的神，会被PUA；每个人只能进一扇门，唯一的故乡和童年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642496e983e630619c932551</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642496e983e630619c932551</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Mar 2023 16:40:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新海诚系列新鲜出炉！</span></p><p><span>“试行错误”主播阿颖，又又又一次和我畅聊动画！</span></p><p><span>古诗云：</span></p><p><span>雨后的天空映彩霞，调皮的大臣爱铃芽，</span></p><p><span>岩手的孩子爱岩手，三峡的孩子爱三峡。</span></p><br><p><span>时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">0:45</a>电影打分总体评价，通俗大师晋升为史诗导演</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">6:05</a>生活细节瞬间的幽默完胜深海</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a>与神共舞，电影里的日本人对神的态度有何特别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a>中日两国对待神的态度有何不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a>不要做日本人的神，会被PUA</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a>姨妈与玲芽、玲芽与白猫两组关系互为对照</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a>人、神、自然灵三角关系，谁是老大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a>如果蚓厄是个淘气的小恶魔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a>成物不可损坏，人偏偏要损坏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a>神是人类美好祈愿的化身，人类的超能力是讲故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a>我眼里的世界跟别人不一样，我要怎么办</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a>加个男主角让电影更好还是更差</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a>为什么年轻人要把自己代入姨妈的角色</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a>铃芽一定不是恋爱脑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3075">51:15</a>勇敢、大方、宽容、善良在任何时代都是值得坚守的品质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a>铃芽和草太的第一次见面是何时何地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3395">56:35</a>每个人只能走进一扇门，就像唯一的故乡和童年</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">1:01:50</a>福祸相依，雨让人们聚在一起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3820">1:03:40</a>有个耗子洞我都得去看看</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4015">1:06:55</a>城市完全随机出门计划</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4430">1:13:50</a>去完全陌生地方的经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4725">1:18:45</a>阿颖在北京被拆墙偷家的经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4925">1:22:05</a>回忆小时候的三峡移民工程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5110">1:25:10</a>如果我被诅咒，希望变成什么物品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5440">1:30:40</a>新海诚永远选择积极和乐观</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5545">1:32:25</a>假如我是铃芽，跟时间赛跑，焦虑啊焦虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5805">1:36:45</a>草太的爷爷一生的致命失误</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5890">1:38:10</a>老铁们打赏，送一波火箭我就把门关上</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6000">1:40:00</a>最感动的情节，自我拯救</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6200">1:43:20</a>推荐作品《夏目友人帐》、《时光代理人》、《恶魔人》、《钢铁神兵》、《日本沉没》、《再生号》、《中国奇谭》</span></p><br>]]></description>
