    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾是来自北方小城的妞妞，这一期，我们一起追溯快乐之源。</span></p><br><p><span>时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a>公园让我向阳而生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a>山西阳泉的滨河公园伴随着我长大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a>下岗潮对矿产小城市民生活的改变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a>童年跟家人散步是记忆里最和谐的图画</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a>幻想有个亲哥哥替自己承担起家里的一切</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a>拒绝父亲躺平！让他向刘慈欣看齐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a>小时候逛公园看到的神奇马戏团</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a>创造快乐的手艺人比GDP更重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a>为什么我没有向往的城市</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3515">58:35</a>家乡有哪些特殊值得留恋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3760">1:02:40</a>在公园里虔诚地向小草和大自然学习</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4250">1:10:50</a>背春晚小品台词，是我们的共同记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4610">1:16:50</a>推荐电影《阿甘正传》、《与玛格丽特的午后》、《晒后假日》</span></p><br>]]></description>
